### Test /api/User/me endpoint directly on UserService

### Step 1: Login to get a fresh token
POST http://localhost:5001/api/User/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@test.com",
  "password": "User@123"
}

### Step 2: Copy the accessToken from above response and paste it below
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Step 3: Test the /me endpoint
GET http://localhost:5001/api/User/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alternative: Test with admin user
POST http://localhost:5001/api/User/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Use admin token
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

GET http://localhost:5001/api/User/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
